 "know_before_you_go": [
  "Guests found with weapons or prohibited items on their person or in their baggage may be denied boarding and could face severe legal penalties.",
  "Disney Cruise Line reserves the right to confiscate and secure any item considered dangerous or a safety risk. Attempting to bring these items on board may also delay the delivery of your luggage to your stateroom.",
  "Drugs, including synthetic or designer drugs, as well as medically prescribed marijuana, are strictly prohibited on board.",
  "Alcohol packed in checked luggage within beverage containers will be confiscated, and no compensation will be provided.",
  "All alcohol brought on board must be in its original, unopened container. Partially used bottles or those with broken seals are not permitted.",
  "Guests are limited to two bottles of wine or sparkling wine, or six beers. Any amount exceeding this will be discarded without compensation.",
  "Alcohol brought on board is not allowed to be consumed in any public area or lounge, and providing alcoholic beverages to other guests, regardless of age, is prohibited.",
  "The legal drinking age on board is 21, and a valid photo ID is required.",
  "For the safety of all guests, certain electrical appliances are prohibited on board. If any restricted items are found in your luggage during security screening, they will be confiscated. However, hairdryers, flat irons, curling irons, and electric shavers are permitted.",
  "Guests travelling in groups or with family can request connecting or adjoining rooms, and in some cases balcony partitions can be opened for shared space.",
  "Most staterooms are designed for comfort with split bathrooms, pull-down beds, and under-bed storage, making them suitable for families and longer stays.",
  "Cabin location matters- midship decks generally experience less motion, while higher decks offer quicker access to pools, attractions, and entertainment areas.",
  "Room themes, décor, and onboard experiences may vary or change depending on sailing schedules or operational updates, so travellers should stay updated before departure.",
  "Guests must complete online check-in before sailing and arrive at the cruise terminal only during their assigned port arrival time to avoid long waits.",
  "Guests should carry all required travel documents and immigration papers, especially during embarkation and debarkation procedures.",
  "Luggage tags are usually delivered to staterooms before departure; travellers should label bags properly for smooth disembarkation and transfers.",
  "Packing essentials such as comfortable resort wear, swimwear, reusable bottles, basic toiletries, and themed outfits can enhance the cruise experience.",
  "Guests travelling with children can utilise age-specific kids’ clubs, nurseries, and teen lounges, while adults can access exclusive lounges, spas, and fitness areas.",
  "Please note that visa charges are included in the package."
 ],
